                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An imperfection in the wick of a candle, causing it to waste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dialectal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4ce5b91-8bbc-3874-882c-43172c2e462f",
                                        "entry_id": "837267db-6568-3dbf-9716-ed208345da85",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A destroyer or plunderer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79383f39-ab7a-4343-9dda-d3d6698b2526",
                                                "sense_id": "b4ce5b91-8bbc-3874-882c-43172c2e462f",
                                                "text": "He also that is slothful in his work is brother to him that is a great waster."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ffb19663-87e1-305a-8877-7d204b6b842c",
                                        "entry_id": "837267db-6568-3dbf-9716-ed208345da85",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An item that is spoiled during its manufacture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "174a0315-196b-40fb-855a-2c2b7bf5fb7c",
                                                "sense_id": "ffb19663-87e1-305a-8877-7d204b6b842c",
                                                "text": "Unless the cast was very hot indeed, the steel would refuse to ascend, and a great many wasters were caused thereby."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "waster",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b9cceef-f824-31b9-8d9c-a3baefee93f4",
                                        "entry_id": "ccfd3acf-b430-37d0-821d-03e13f4413c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A kind of cudgel; also, a blunt-edged sword used as a foil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "178ae9d8-52a0-481f-940d-a93efe30c16c",
                                                "sense_id": "1b9cceef-f824-31b9-8d9c-a3baefee93f4",
                                                "text": "Or, as they that play at wasters exercise themselves by a few cudgels how to avoid an enemy's blows, let us arm ourselves against all such violent incursions which may invade our minds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f9fb003-87eb-3e63-bba4-8c8223b389ab",
                                        "entry_id": "ccfd3acf-b430-37d0-821d-03e13f4413c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A leister; a spear for catching fish."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Scotland",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
